{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bbbb4f654660345b","name":"The Corporate Alliance","source":{"id":"source:reference-bbbb4f654660345b","title":"The Corporate Alliance","revision":23768,"timestamp":"2024-10-06T21:40:54Z","sha256":"a80a060d0c370de8e80166b2e7b3e6277304a63f25a70740c6a0e52688a82856","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23768","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Corporate%20Alliance&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bbbb4f654660345b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Corporate Alliance- the organization in charge of regulating sales and distribution throughout the galaxy- knows all along that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," will not miss them if they leave; there will always be someone else more than eager to fill their seats in the Senate. But its Magistrate, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Passel Argente"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Passel_Argente?action=edit&redlink=1"},", is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Koorivar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Koorivar?action=edit&redlink=1"},"- a Species driven from its adopted homeworld by a Republic resolution that ceded the planet to another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," over two thousand years before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Koorivars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Koorivars?action=edit&redlink=1"}," have never forgiven the Republic for the grievous injury, so Magistrate Argente feels no compunctions whatsoever about joining the Separatist movement, pledging The Corporate Alliance wholeheartedly to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Corporate Alliance maintains a small security force, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Koorivar Fusiliers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Koorivar_Fusiliers","referenceId":"reference:a13b692dd696ec7d"},", whose job is primarily to guard Alliance facilities against sabotage and industrial espionage. Like ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Commerce Guild"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Commerce_Guild","referenceId":"reference:9d27b12029ae3f0d"},", though, they also have a sizeable force of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", composed entirely of their devastating ",{"tag":"a","children":["NR-N99 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Persuader"]},"-Class Droid Enforcers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/NR-N99_Persuader-Class_Droid_Enforcers"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Command Structure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Koorivar Fusiliers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Koorivar_Fusiliers","referenceId":"reference:a13b692dd696ec7d"}," have a command structure similar to the Grand Army's, though not quite as extensive. Much of the Fusiliers' armed might relies on artillery emplacements, which are always crewed by two fusilier engineers and a crew leader.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Squad (12 Fusiliers):"]}," The Fusilier's smallest group is the Squad, led by a Sergeant."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Platoon (36 Fusiliers):"]}," A Platoon consists of 3 Squads, led by a Lieutenant."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Company (108 Fusiliers plus support personnel):"]}," A Company consists of 3 Platoons, led by a Captain."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Battalion (324 Fusiliers plus support personnel):"]}," A Battalion consists of 3 Companies, led by a Colonel."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Regiment (972 Fusiliers plus support personnel):"]}," A Regiment consists of 3 Battalions, led by a General."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Corporate Alliance's Droid units consist entirely of Squads of 2-4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["NR-N99 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Persuader"]},"-Class Droid Enforcers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/NR-N99_Persuader-Class_Droid_Enforcers"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
